<p>An idea for an ever-changing bottle of cleaning supplies that could be deadly if used incorrectly&#8230;</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch:</p>
<p>It is a safe-class object.<br />
It manifests as a random bottle of cleaning supplies consistent with several non-anomolous brands of cleaning supplies.<br />
It causes horrible injuries to people who use the bottle's contents for any purpose other than cleaning.<br />
Injuries range from lacerations to third-degree burns on your face.<br />
Can change form when unobserved for a period of ██ to █ hours</p>
<p>Safe<br />
Central Narrative:<br />
In a foundation sweep of a anomalous materials distribution operation in █████, ██████. The object was found in a janitorial closet in the building where the operations were taking place. The object in question was at the time taking the form of a bottle of clorox-brand bleach. On the return to site-██ It had changed into the form of a bottle of windex. It's dangerous properties were discovered when during a test of it's chemical composition the researcher spontaneously combusted and suffered lacerations. Further tests concluded that the object was only dangerous when being used in a way the object's label did not support.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber:<br />
An everyday object that will never hurt you if you use it right, But if you dare step out of line, A painful punishment awaits.</p>

